" fill="#334155">uzanırken her hâlde Allah\'ı anma.</text>\n  <text x="350" y="160" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#b45309">Tefekkür (Zihni Sorgulama)</text>\n  <text x="350" y="178" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#334155">• Yaratılıştaki sebep, gaye</text>\n  <text x="350" y="194" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#334155">ve hikmeti derinlemesine düşünme.</text>\n\n  <rect x="470" y="45" width="210" height="185" rx="10" fill="#dcfce7" stroke="#16a34a" stroke-width="2"/>\n  <text x="575" y="68" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#166534">3. ULAŞILAN HAKİKAT VE DUA</text>\n  <rect x="482" y="80" width="186" height="135" rx="6" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#4ade80" stroke-width="1.2"/>\n  <text x="575" y="102" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#15803d">Gaye ve Hikmet Bilinci</text>\n  <text x="575" y="120" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#334155">• \'Rabbimiz! Bunu boşuna</text>\n  <text x="575" y="136" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#334155">(bâtıl olarak) yaratmadın!\'</text>\n  <text x="575" y="160" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#15803d">Tenzih ve Ahiret Bilinci</text>\n  <text x="575" y="178" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#334155">• \'Seni eksikliklerden tenzih ederiz;</text>\n  <text x="575" y="194" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#334155">bizi cehennem azabından koru!\'</text>\n</svg>', '<svg viewBox="0 0 700 220" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="Arial, sans-serif">\n  <rect width="700" height="220" fill="#f8fafc" rx="12"/>\n  <text x="350" y="28" text-anchor="middle" font-size="15" font-weight="bold" fill="#0f172a">TEFEKKÜRDEN SORUMLULUĞA GEÇİŞ SÜRECİ</text>\n  <rect x="20" y="52" width="145" height="135" rx="8" fill="#e0f2fe" stroke="#0284c7" stroke-width="1.8"/>\n  <text x="92" y="78" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" fill="#0369a1">1. GÖZLEM</text>\